Custom GPTs let you package a repeatable job — a quoting assistant that knows your rates, or an HR helper loaded with your handbook — and share it with colleagues. Connectors to Google Drive, SharePoint and other tools mean it can work with the files you already have.

For business use, choose the Business (formerly Team) or Enterprise plans, where OpenAI does not train on your data by default and you get admin controls. On the free and Plus plans, switch off training in data controls before using client information. Its default spelling is American, so ask explicitly for British English.', 'https://chatgpt.com', 'freemium', 'yes', 'yes', null, 9.3, 'ChatGPT remains the Swiss Army knife of AI: fast, multimodal, packed with integrations and custom GPTs, and familiar to almost everyone you will hire.', array['All-round use, image generation and custom GPT workflows']::text[], array['Huge feature set: images, voice, data analysis, browsing','Custom GPTs for repeatable business tasks','Largest ecosystem of integrations and tutorials','Fast and generous free tier']::text[], array['US spelling unless instructed otherwise','Can sound generic without good prompting','Consumer plans need data-training settings changed']::text[]) on conflict (slug) do update set company_id = excluded.company_id, name = excluded.name, status = excluded.status, short_description = excluded.short_description, long_description = excluded.long_description, website_url = excluded.website_url, pricing_model = excluded.pricing_model, free_plan = excluded.free_plan, api_available = excluded.api_available, open_source = excluded.open_source, editorial_score = excluded.editorial_score, editorial_notes = excluded.editorial_notes, best_for = excluded.best_for, pros = excluded.pros, cons = excluded.cons, updated_at = now();
